.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH portensor-distributed-agent 1  "agent "
.SH NAME
portensor\-distributed\-agent \- Listen for jobs pushed by a coordinator (inbound mode)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBagent\fR [\fB\-\-listen\fR] [\fB\-\-token\fR] [\fB\-\-tls\-cert\fR] [\fB\-\-tls\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-concurrency\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Listen for jobs pushed by a coordinator (inbound mode)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-listen\fR \fI<ADDR>\fR [default: 127.0.0.1:9091]
Agent listen address. Set \-\-tls\-cert and \-\-tls\-key to serve HTTPS
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR \fI<TOKEN>\fR
Bearer token (or PORTENSOR_DISTRIBUTED_TOKEN), at least 16 characters
.TP
\fB\-\-tls\-cert\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
PEM certificate chain for the agent\*(Aqs HTTPS listener
.TP
\fB\-\-tls\-key\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
PEM private key for the agent\*(Aqs HTTPS listener
.TP
\fB\-\-concurrency\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 1]
Maximum scans executed concurrently on this agent
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
